{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-jannat","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"jannat-deyaar-development-dubai-production-city","about":"Jannat - a stylish project by Deyaar Properties. The development offers luxurious and upscale housing options in one of the most popular neighbourhoods of the city. The project features apartments, villas and townhouses with carefully considered design and layouts. Jannat Dubai is characterised by contemporary architecture, high quality construction and attention to detail, providing residents with modern and elegant living. Jannat is strategically located in close proximity to major attractions, business districts, recreational facilities and transport hubs, ensuring residents have easy access to everything they need for a comfortable and enjoyable lifestyle. Maesem City Centre and Dubai Sports City are approximately 8 minutes away. Within a 15-20 minute radius are Mall of Emirates, Dubai Mall, JBR Walk, Emirates Hills, Arabian Ranches and Palm Jumeirah.Apart from the well-designed apartments, the complex also offers a host of world-class amenities and facilities. These include landscaped gardens, swimming pools, fitness centres, recreational areas, children's play areas and 24-hour security. Jannat is an excellent choice for individuals and families looking to invest in luxurious and comfortable accommodation in one of Dubai's most vibrant neighbourhoods.","price":878137,"title":"Jannat","bitrix":{"id":609,"pf_id":"are.3.12860","source":null,"project_id":"Midtown","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Jannat","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Deyaar","project_location":"Dubai Production City (IMPZ)"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/331/images/2023/07/07/340x252/nUqKEf012CWebzBb9j0lJI4VjpetYREBINmInWED.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/331/images/2023/07/07/464x31